              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What size lawn mower deck do I need for a small yard?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For yards under a quarter acre, a 14-16 inch deck is often easier to maneuver around beds, trees, and tight side yards than a full 21-inch deck, even though it takes more passes to cover the same area. For yards between a quarter and half acre, a 20-21 inch deck strikes a better balance of coverage speed and maneuverability.
