                Yes, for a small, flat lawn that's mowed on a regular weekly schedule. Reel mowers struggle with tall or overgrown grass, slopes, and rocky or root-covered terrain, but on a well-maintained small lawn they provide a clean, quiet cut with zero fuel or battery cost.
              </p>
