              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Robot mowers look effortless in advertising, but installing the boundary wire, mapping no-go zones, and troubleshooting the first few autonomous runs is a genuine multi-hour project, not a plug-and-go purchase. Budget the setup time honestly before committing to this category.
              </p>
            </div>
